{"id":"limits","类型":"公式本","科目":"高数","讲":"1","名称":"等价无穷小与重要极限","简称":"极限","简介":"算极限的第一反应：乘除因子换等价，1^∞ 套公式，加减里要精确就上泰勒。","intro":[{"t":"p","text":"**等价只能在乘除里换**：$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{\\tan x-\\sin x}{x^3}$ 不能把 $\\tan x$、$\\sin x$ 都换成 $x$（会得 0，错）。先提出公因子 $\\tan x(1-\\cos x)$，变成乘积再换；或者直接用下面第 2 组的「差的等价」，那几条是从[[泰勒:sin|泰勒公式]]读出来的，加减里也能用。"},{"t":"p","text":"下面的 $x$ 可以换成任何趋于 0 的式子：$\\sin x^2\\sim x^2$，$\\ln\\left(1+\\frac1n\\right)\\sim\\frac1n$，$e^{\\sin x}-1\\sim\\sin x$。"}],"sections":[{"id":"1","label":"1","title":"一阶等价（x→0）","minutes":0,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"f","id":"sinx","name":"$\\sin x$ 一族","tex":"\\sin x\\sim\\tan x\\sim\\arcsin x\\sim\\arctan x\\sim x","note":"三角、反三角函数在 0 附近都像 $x$。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"lnx","name":"对数与指数","tex":"\\ln(1+x)\\sim x,\\qquad e^x-1\\sim x\na^x-1\\sim x\\ln a","note":"$a^x-1=e^{x\\ln a}-1$，所以多一个 $\\ln a$。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"cosx","name":"$1-\\cos x$","tex":"1-\\cos x\\sim\\frac{x^2}{2}","note":"这是二阶的，分母常是 $x^2$。$1-\\cos x=2\\sin^2\\frac x2$ 一眼看出。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"powx","name":"$(1+x)^\\alpha-1$","tex":"(1+x)^\\alpha-1\\sim\\alpha x","note":"根式最常用：$\\sqrt{1+x}-1\\sim\\frac x2$，$\\sqrt[n]{1+x}-1\\sim\\frac xn$。","cor":""}]},{"id":"2","label":"2","title":"差的等价（x→0，加减里也能用）","minutes":0,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"f","id":"xsin","name":"$x-\\sin x$","tex":"x-\\sin x\\sim\\frac{x^3}{6}\n\\arcsin x-x\\sim\\frac{x^3}{6}","note":"两个都是 $\\frac{x^3}6$。符号看谁大：$0<x<1$ 时 $\\sin x<x<\\arcsin x$。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"tanx","name":"$\\tan x-x$","tex":"\\tan x-x\\sim\\frac{x^3}{3}\nx-\\arctan x\\sim\\frac{x^3}{3}","note":"两个都是 $\\frac{x^3}3$。$0<x<\\frac\\pi2$ 时 $\\arctan x<x<\\tan x$。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"tansin","name":"$\\tan x-\\sin x$","tex":"\\tan x-\\sin x\\sim\\frac{x^3}{2}","note":"$\\tan x-\\sin x=\\tan x\\,(1-\\cos x)\\sim x\\cdot\\frac{x^2}{2}$。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"xln","name":"$x-\\ln(1+x)$","tex":"x-\\ln(1+x)\\sim\\frac{x^2}{2}\ne^x-1-x\\sim\\frac{x^2}{2}","note":"都是泰勒展开的第二项。","cor":""}]},{"id":"3","label":"3","title":"重要极限与 1^∞","minutes":0,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"f","id":"sinlim","name":"第一个重要极限","tex":"\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\sin x}{x}=1","note":"就是 $\\sin x\\sim x$。注意 $x\\to\\infty$ 时 $\\frac{\\sin x}{x}\\to0$（有界量乘无穷小），别混。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"elim","name":"第二个重要极限","tex":"\\lim_{x\\to0}(1+x)^{\\frac1x}=e\n\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\left(1+\\frac1x\\right)^x=e","note":"底数趋于 1、指数趋于无穷，而且两者互为倒数。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"one","name":"$1^\\infty$ 型","tex":"\\lim u^v=e^{\\lim(u-1)v}\\quad{(u\\to1,\\ v\\to\\infty)}","note":"「底数减 1，乘指数」，算出的极限放到 $e$ 的指数上。比取对数快。","cor":"$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}\\left(1+\\dfrac ax\\right)^{bx}=e^{ab}$"},{"t":"f","id":"uv","name":"幂指函数","tex":"u^v=e^{v\\ln u}","note":"$0^0$、$\\infty^0$ 型都先写成 $e^{v\\ln u}$，再算指数 $v\\ln u$ 的极限。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"lhopital","name":"洛必达法则","tex":"\\lim\\frac{f(x)}{g(x)}=\\lim\\frac{f'(x)}{g'(x)}","note":"只能用于 $\\frac00$、$\\frac\\infty\\infty$，并且右边的极限存在（或为 $\\infty$）。每用一次先化简：能换等价先换，非零因子先算出来。","cor":""}]},{"id":"4","label":"4","title":"比快慢","minutes":0,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"f","id":"order","name":"增长快慢（x→+∞）","tex":"\\ln^\\alpha x\\ll x^\\beta\\ll a^x\\ll x^x\n{(\\alpha,\\beta>0,\\ a>1)}","note":"对数 < 幂 < 指数 < 幂指。比如 $\\frac{\\ln x}{x^\\beta}\\to0$，$\\frac{x^n}{e^x}\\to0$。","cor":"数列：$\\ln n\\ll n^\\beta\\ll a^n\\ll n!\\ll n^n$。"},{"t":"f","id":"small","name":"0 附近的对数","tex":"\\lim_{x\\to0^+}x^\\beta\\ln x=0\\quad{(\\beta>0)}","note":"幂趋于 0 比 $\\ln x$ 趋于 $-\\infty$ 快。$x\\ln x\\to0$、$x^x\\to1$ 都是它。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"nroot","name":"$\\sqrt[n]{n}$","tex":"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\sqrt[n]{n}=1\n\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\sqrt[n]{a}=1\\quad{(a>0)}","note":"$\\sqrt[n]n=e^{\\frac{\\ln n}{n}}$，指数趋于 0。","cor":""},{"t":"f","id":"poly","name":"抓大头","tex":"\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\frac{a_0x^m+\\cdots}{b_0x^n+\\cdots}=\\begin{cases}\\dfrac{a_0}{b_0},&m=n\\\\0,&m<n\\\\\\infty,&m>n\\end{cases}","note":"分子分母同除以最高次幂，只剩最高次项说了算。","cor":""}]}],"used":{}}